'''Silver Synthwave''' is a [[Unique Weapons|Unique]] knife obtained by finishing 2nd on the tokens collecting leaderboard {{Currency|Beach Ball}} during the [[Summer Event 2025]]. 

== Appearance ==
'''Silver Synthwave''' is the Ancient variation of [[Synthwave]] Evo knife, but colored with a white border and a silver-to-gray gradient.

== Trivia ==

* The sole owner of this weapon is [https://www.roblox.com/users/725925211/profile Walrus8495].

